>> Combination := Liosta nua.

Combination ar: ['iarcheangail:'] déan: { :el
	féin 
	faigh: el, Neamhní? fíor: { féin iarcheangail: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination nua.
colours
	iarcheangail: ['red'],
	iarcheangail: ['green'],
	iarcheangail: ['blue'],
	iarcheangail: ['red'].

Aschur scríobh: colours, líne-nua.
